## Daily Time Reset

- Changed the business day reset from the previous early-morning boundary to `8:00 PM Asia/Karachi`.
- Dashboard/report totals now use the business day range:
  - Start: 8:00 PM Pakistan time.
  - End: next day 8:00 PM Pakistan time.
- Updated attendance aggregation so sessions that cross 8 PM only count the overlap inside the current business day.
- Updated session listing to use the same 8 PM business-day boundary.
- Updated the reports page so it no longer forces a browser UTC date for "today"; the API now owns the business-day calculation.

